---
import Layout from '@estate/ui/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
const p=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const endpoint=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT || '';
const nav=[{label:'The vision',href:'#vision'},{label:'Residences',href:'#residences'},{label:'Amenities',href:'#amenities'},{label:'Location',href:'#location'},{label:'Enquire',href:'#enquire'}];
const types=[{name:'The Horizon',bedrooms:'2 bedrooms',size:'1,450 sq ft',image:'residence-a.webp',plan:'horizon-plan.svg'},{name:'The Sanctuary',bedrooms:'3 bedrooms',size:'2,180 sq ft',image:'residence-b.webp',plan:'sanctuary-plan.svg'}];
---
<Layout title="SERA / COAST | A Fictional Design-Led Development" description="Discover SERA / COAST, a premium fictional coastal development concept with illustrative residences, architecture, floor plans, payment schedule and registration form." brand="SERA / COAST" nav={nav} accent="#302520">
<section class="hero"><img src={`${p}assets/developer-desert.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated minimalist stone-residence architecture study in an imagined landscape; not an existing building" width="836" height="471" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-copy container"><p class="eyebrow">AN ARCHITECTURAL STUDY / IMAGINED LANDSCAPE</p><h1>Where the horizon<br>feels <em>closer.</em></h1><p>An imagined world of stone, light and open horizons.</p><a class="light-link" href="#vision">Discover SERA / COAST <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-foot container"><span>A FICTIONAL DEVELOPMENT</span><span>CONCEPT STUDY / 2026</span></div></section>
<section id="vision" class="vision-section container"><div class="section-label"><span>01 / THE VISION</span><span>COMPOSED IN LIGHT</span></div><div class="vision-grid"><h2>To live well is<br>to live <em>simply.</em></h2><div><p class="lead">SERA / COAST is an imagined address shaped by the sea, the landscape and the beautiful rhythm of everyday life.</p><p>Our fictional architectural concept places calm interiors, warm materials and generous outdoor space at the centre of the residential experience. These images are illustrations, not renderings of a real development.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="architecture-section"><div class="architecture-grid"><div class="architecture-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / ARCHITECTURE</p><h2>Quiet form.<br><em>Lasting feeling.</em></h2><p>Strong horizontal planes, carefully framed views, filtered sunlight and warm stone surfaces create a relationship between the building and its imagined coastal setting.</p><ul><li>Restrained material palette</li><li>Deep shaded terraces</li><li>Landscaped transitions</li><li>Natural light as a design element</li></ul><p class="fine">Original concept design only. No completed building exists.</p></div><img src={`${p}assets/sera-architecture.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated close-up of stone facade and glazed terraces for a fictional design" width="877" height="825" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
<section id="residences" class="residences-section container"><div class="section-label"><span>03 / THE RESIDENCES</span><span>SPACES THAT BREATHE</span></div><div class="section-title"><h2>Every day, more <em>considered.</em></h2><p>Two sample home profiles, drawn to communicate the design intent. Unit sizes, layouts and inventory are fictional.</p></div><div class="residence-grid">{types.map((t,i)=><article class="residence-card"><img src={`${p}assets/${t.image}`} alt={`Original AI-generated fictional residential lifestyle concept for ${t.name}; not an actual unit`} width="836" height="471" loading="lazy"/><div class="residence-info"><span class="eyebrow">0{i+1} / RESIDENCE TYPE</span><h3>{t.name}</h3><p>{t.bedrooms} <span>·</span> {t.size} (sample)</p><a href={`${p}floorplans/${t.plan}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="view_floor_plan">View illustrative floor plan ↗</a></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="masterplan-section" id="masterplan"><div class="container masterplan-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / MASTERPLAN</p><h2>Space for<br><em>what matters.</em></h2><p>The imagined masterplan moves from landscaped arrival to residential courtyard, shared amenities and quiet coastal edge.</p><div class="masterplan-legend"><span><b>01</b> Residential collection</span><span><b>02</b> Garden courts</span><span><b>03</b> Pool terrace</span><span><b>04</b> Coastal promenade</span></div></div><figure><img src={`${p}assets/sera-masterplan.svg`} alt="Conceptual masterplan diagram for a fictional development, not a real site map" width="1100" height="900" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>CONCEPT DIAGRAM / NOT TO SCALE</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section id="amenities" class="amenities-section container"><div class="section-label"><span>05 / THE AMENITIES</span><span>A RHYTHM ALL YOUR OWN</span></div><div class="amenity-intro"><h2>Less noise.<br><em>More room to live.</em></h2><p>Spaces imagined around movement, rest and a sense of connection to an imagined landscape.</p></div><div class="amenities-grid"><img src={`${p}assets/sera-pool.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated pool terrace concept for a fictional development, not an existing amenity" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy"/><div class="amenity-list">{[['01','The pool garden','An open-air place to pause.'],['02','The residents’ lounge','Informal spaces to meet and unwind.'],['03','The movement studio','Room for wellness and everyday rituals.'],['04','The shaded promenade','An imagined passage toward the coast.']].map(([number,name,description])=><div><span>{number}</span><div><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p></div></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="concept-film-section container" aria-labelledby="concept-film-title">
  <div class="section-label"><span>ARCHITECTURAL CONCEPT FILM</span><span>ANIMATED STILLS / NOT ACTUAL FOOTAGE</span></div>
  <div class="film-header"><h2 id="concept-film-title">A sense of <em>arrival.</em></h2><p>Eight seconds of gentle motion from an original AI-generated architectural concept still. This is not footage of a real building.</p></div>
  <video class="concept-film" controls playsinline preload="none" poster={`${p}assets/developer-desert.webp`} aria-label="Play an original animated concept montage of fictional coastal residences">
    <source src={`${p}media/developer-concept-motion.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
    Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
  </video>
</section>
<section class="gallery-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-label"><span>06 / GALLERY</span><span>ORIGINAL CONCEPT ART</span></div><h2>The art of <em>quiet spaces.</em></h2><div class="gallery-grid"><figure><img src={`${p}assets/developer-desert.webp`} alt="AI-generated architectural visualization of fictional SERA / COAST" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Exterior / AI-generated concept</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={`${p}assets/residence-a.webp`} alt="AI-generated conceptual apartment interior, not a real unit" width="836" height="471" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Interior / AI-generated concept</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={`${p}assets/sera-pool.webp`} alt="AI-generated illustrative pool terrace" width="1080" height="500" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Pool terrace / AI-generated concept</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section id="location" class="location-section container"><div class="section-label"><span>07 / THE LOCATION</span><span>AN IMAGINED COASTAL SETTING</span></div><div class="location-grid"><div><h2>A sense of place<br>by the <em>water.</em></h2><p>SERA / COAST is a fictional residential setting inspired by coastal living. The diagram suggests a relationship between gardens, residences and shoreline rather than any real geographic coordinates.</p><p class="fine">No precise location, site ownership, permits, distances or transport times are represented.</p></div><img src={`${p}assets/sera-location.svg`} alt="Non-geographic concept location illustration without real coordinates" width="950" height="760" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
<section class="payment-section" id="payment"><div class="container payment-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">08 / PAYMENT PLAN</p><h2>Thoughtful by<br><em>design.</em></h2><p>An example payment structure to illustrate how a project microsite could present buyer information. No real payment plan or offer exists.</p></div><div class="payment-block"><span>ILLUSTRATIVE STRUCTURE</span><div class="payment-bar"><span style="width:20%">20%</span><span style="width:50%">50%</span><span style="width:30%">30%</span></div><dl><div><dt>On reservation</dt><dd>20%</dd></div><div><dt>During construction</dt><dd>50%</dd></div><div><dt>On handover</dt><dd>30%</dd></div></dl><p>Sample handover: Q4 2029. All milestones are invented for this exercise.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="enquire" class="enquire-section container"><div><p class="eyebrow">09 / REGISTER INTEREST</p><h2>Stay close to<br><em>the idea.</em></h2><p>Explore what a premium project enquiry journey could look like. This concept does not represent an actual development for sale.</p><a class="brochure" href={`${p}brochure/sera-concept-brochure.pdf`} download data-track="download_brochure">Download sample brochure <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><form id="sera-interest" class="interest-form" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} method="post" action={`${p}api/lead`}><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PREFERENCES</p><div class="interest-fields"><label>Residence type *<select name="residence" required><option value="">Select a residence</option><option>2 bedroom</option><option>3 bedroom</option><option>Exploring</option></select></label><label>Budget *<select name="budget" required><option value="">Select sample budget</option><option>Under AED 3M</option><option>AED 3–5M</option><option>Above AED 5M</option><option>Undecided</option></select></label><label>Purchase purpose *<select name="purpose" required><option value="">Select purpose</option><option>Personal use</option><option>Investment</option><option>Both</option></select></label><label>Timeline *<select name="timeline" required><option value="">Select timeline</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>3–12 months</option><option>Research only</option></select></label><label>Full name *<input type="text" name="name" minlength="2" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Your name" /></label><label>Email *<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" /></label><label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+971 50 000 0000" /></label><label>Financing<select name="financing"><option>Undecided</option><option>Cash</option><option>Mortgage</option></select></label></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required /><span>I consent to contact if a real operator is configured. <a href={`${p}privacy/`}>Privacy notice</a>.</span></label><button type="submit" class="send">Register interest (demo) ↗</button><p data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
</Layout>
